# Superstore Sales Performance Dashboard

## Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing sales performance data from a Superstore dataset using Microsoft Power BI. The dashboard was developed to uncover key business insights related to sales, profit, customer performance, and regional trends through interactive visualizations and data storytelling.

The goal of this project is to help stakeholders make informed business decisions by transforming raw sales data into meaningful and actionable insights.

---

## Objectives
- Analyze overall sales and profit performance
- Identify top-performing customers and regions
- Discover profitable product sub-categories
- Monitor monthly sales trends
- Create an interactive and visually appealing dashboard

---

## Tools & Technologies Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX (Data Analysis Expressions)
- Excel/CSV Dataset

---

## Dataset Information
Dataset Used: Superstore Sales Dataset

The dataset contains:
- Sales transactions
- Product categories and sub-categories
- Customer information
- Regional sales data
- Order dates
- Profit and quantity metrics

---

## Data Cleaning & Transformation
The following preprocessing steps were carried out:
- Checked for missing values
- Corrected data types
- Removed inconsistencies
- Created calculated measures using DAX
- Formatted fields for analysis
- Built interactive filters and slicers

---

## KPIs Created
- Total Sales
- Total Profit
- Total Orders
- Profit Margin

---

## Dashboard Features
### Interactive Features
- Region filtering
- Date slicers
- Category filtering
- Cross-visual interaction

### Visualizations Included
- Monthly Sales Trend
- Top Customers by Sales
- Sales by State
- Profit by Sub-Category
- Sales by Category
- Profit by Region
- KPI Cards

---

## Key Insights
- Technology category generated the highest sales contribution.
- California recorded the highest sales across states.
- The East region achieved the highest profit performance.
- November recorded the highest monthly sales.
- Copiers generated the highest profit among sub-categories.

---

## Recommendations
- Increase investment in high-performing technology products.
- Improve strategies in lower-performing regions.
- Monitor seasonal sales trends closely.
- Maintain inventory availability for profitable products.

---

## Challenges Faced
- Cleaning inconsistent data fields
- Choosing the most effective visualizations
- Designing a clean and balanced dashboard layout
- Creating meaningful business insights from raw data

---

## Conclusion
This project demonstrates how Power BI can be used to transform raw business data into interactive dashboards and actionable insights. The dashboard supports data-driven decision-making by presenting sales and profitability trends in a clear and professional format.

